<h1>BlueGate Security Monitor</h1>

<h2>Windows Security Monitoring & Detection Engineering</h2>

<p>
  BlueGate is a Windows-focused security monitoring application
  being developed to investigate suspicious system activity
  using Sysmon telemetry and behavioural detection techniques.
</p>

<p>
  Built using C# and .NET 8, the application processes Windows
  security telemetry, evaluates detection rules and records
  security alerts in a SQLite database.
</p>

<p>
  The project incorporates MITRE ATT&CK-aligned detection logic,
  including monitoring PowerShell-related outbound network
  activity. Future development will expand detection coverage,
  risk scoring and security event investigation capabilities.
</p>


